   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line1.2289FE",
   "szText": "Saying farewell to this place is harder than I imagined. I must seal it to ease the aching—it only reopens the wound. Our decision to part was one of wisdom, but wisdom is a cold companion. I hope she does not think of me. For her sake. Goodbye, my light.",
